        "en": "Chapter 2 cites step 2 of Probability & Frequency: the larger the sample, the closer the frequency to the probability; conversely a small sample’s average swings more, with standard error 10/√n."
      },
      "source": "../probability/everyday/numbers-lie/#c2"
